{"channelId":"UCrSHcsDIA1dbhJDdxLzoTHg","row":["EdwardX Cat Rescue",16600,"Hi everyone my name is Edward and I help homeless animals!\nNow I live in Georgia, the city of Batumi.\nUnfortunately there are a huge number of homeless cats and dogs here.\nAnimals are sick, injured and have poor nutrition.\nI and other volunteers are trying to help animals, we catch them, we spay them, if the animal can live with a family of people then we try to find a home, if the animal is completely feral then after recovery and vaccination we let it go to live on.\nSubscribe, it will be very interesting!","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrSHcsDIA1dbhJDdxLzoTHg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrSHcsDIA1dbhJDdxLzoTHg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:36.960Z","channelId":"UCrSHcsDIA1dbhJDdxLzoTHg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"09b8cfe72398432c97ffe2d2e0663e8db13e21d2dcfcb3f47fb0f2da8f03a5eb","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"2a6ec2cdfa4f76f67c69e82376e76ccea3e63b33484a0ac26ff1d58a0d451c8e"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrSHcsDIA1dbhJDdxLzoTHg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:24:05.213Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrSHcsDIA1dbhJDdxLzoTHg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":16600,"raw":"16.6K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrSHcsDIA1dbhJDdxLzoTHg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:36.960Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"name_only","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undetermined","excerpt":"Hi everyone my name is Edward and I help homeless animals! Now I live in Georgia, the city o